    <string name="how_to">How to</string>
    <string name="how_to_sub">Each move two ways: hand / controller</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick">Pick a tool, change size</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick_hand">Pinch a tool on the tray; pinch its empty slot to change size</string>
    <string name="how_to_pick_ctrl">Point at a tool and pull the trigger: it rides the controller. Stick up / down = size, B / Y = put back</string>
    <string name="how_to_add">Add</string>
    <string name="how_to_add_hand">Pinch thumb and finger and drag on the clay: it swells there</string>
    <string name="how_to_add_ctrl">Touch the clay with the tip, hold the trigger and drag</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve">Carve</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve_hand">Pinch and drag to cut a groove; a quick pinch digs a pit</string>
    <string name="how_to_carve_ctrl">Touch the clay, hold the trigger and drag; a quick pull digs a pit</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth">Smooth (scrape flat)</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth_hand">Pinch and sweep along the surface: edges become flats</string>
    <string name="how_to_smooth_ctrl">Lay the blade on the clay, hold the trigger and sweep</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull">Pull</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull_hand">Pinch a bit of clay and pull it out, as far as you like</string>
    <string name="how_to_pull_ctrl">Touch the clay, hold the trigger and pull outward</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn">Turn the clay</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn_hand">Pinch the turntable rim and turn it, or tap Turn 90°</string>
    <string name="how_to_turn_ctrl">Stick left / right: a push turns 90°, holding turns slowly</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench">Move the bench</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench_hand">Pinch the board\'s rim and drag; let go and it stays</string>
    <string name="how_to_bench_ctrl">Point at the rim, hold the trigger and drag; stick turns it 15°</string>
    <string name="about_no_hands">Hand tracking is off: no pinching up close</string>
    <string name="hint_bench">Moving the bench: let go and it stays</string>
    <string name="hint_bench_sub">Stick left / right turns it; near the dashed frame it snaps in</string>
